<fw type="catch" place="bottom"><hi rendition="#b">Alle</hi></fw><lb/>
<pb n="103" facs="#f0123"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b">im Fi&#x017F;chbein-Rocke.</hi></fw><lb/>
<stage><hi rendition="#b">Alle zu&#x017F;ammen:</hi></stage></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#GLAUZANCKSEU "><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Fr. Glaubel.<lb/>
Fr. Zanckenh.<lb/>
Fr. Seuffzer.</hi><lb/>
</speaker><p>Ach! bleiben &#x017F;ie Herr Magi&#x017F;ter!<lb/>
